WEBVTT

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.447
So how come [this is]
something that everyone uses

00:04:30.471 --> 00:04:32.358
and they think others will not stop it?

00:04:32.382 --> 00:04:33.631
What is special with this?

00:04:33.655 --> 00:04:36.519
I had to do an analysis
about the energy use in the world.

00:04:36.543 --> 00:04:37.709
Here we are.

00:04:37.733 --> 00:04:40.249
Look here. You see
the seven billion people up there?

00:04:40.273 --> 00:04:42.276
The air people, the wash people,

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.088
the bulb people and the fire people.

00:04:45.112 --> 00:04:47.129
One unit like this

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:52.276
is an energy unit of fossil fuel --
oil, coal or gas.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.887
That's what most of the electricity
and the energy in the world is.

00:04:55.911 --> 00:04:59.030
And it's 12 units used
in the entire world,

00:04:59.054 --> 00:05:01.861
and the richest one billion,
they use six of them.